---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { siteOperator } from '../lib/site-operator';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About OpenSkies"
>
  <p>
    OpenSkies is a collection of sky photos you can download and use freely.
  </p>
  <p>
    All photos are taken by hand, none are AI-generated. However, some
    photos may be upscaled with AI to increase resolution. This is done to make
    larger sizes available for download while preserving the original photograph.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions or feedback? Send me a <a href="https://x.com/messages/compose?recipient_id=2838010415">message on X</a> or an <a href={`mailto:${siteOperator.email}`}>email</a>.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
